OL,3,GNEWSAWhen will Wolverhampton's
OL,4,AChristmas lights switch on?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dates for Wolverhampton's Christmas
OL,7,Flights switch-on events have been
OL,8,Fannounced by the city council.
OL,10,FFestivities get underway with a
OL,11,Ffunfair, food and drinks as well as
OL,12,Fother entertainment on Victoria Street
OL,13,Fin the city centre on 21 November,
OL,14,Fbefore the lights are switched on at
OL,15,F18:00 GMT.
OL,17,FLights will then be switched on on High
OL,18,FStreet in Wednesfield on 26 November,
OL,19,Ffollowed by Church Street in Bilston on
OL,20,F27 November and Upper Green in
OL,21,FTettenhall on 28 November.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
