OL,3,GNEWSAWhen will Wolverhampton's
OL,4,AChristmas lights switch on?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCity of Wolverhampton Council leader,
OL,7,FStephen Simkins, said the city would
OL,8,Falso host its first Bilston Christmas
OL,9,FVillage and encouraged residents to
OL,10,Fattend the events.
